1930 IF D(M)<100000 GOTO 1970
1940 PRINT "YOU HAVE SLAIN THE WUMPUS"
1950 S=S-1
1960 GOTO 1620
1970 IF INT(D(M)/1000)=INT(D(M)/10000)*10 GOTO 2050
